Maintainer: Meld maintainers <meld@example.invalid>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), cargo, rustc (>= 1.90)
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: meld-lang
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Meld language-composition compiler, CLI and language server
 Meld composes language-tagged regions inside one source file. This package
 installs the `meld`, `meld-lsp` and `meld-pack` binaries together with the
 bundled Lang Pack data, documentation and license texts.
 .
 The package is named meld-lang to avoid a collision with the existing `meld`
 diff tool. No language runtime is installed or pulled in as a dependency.
